# The backends' sources: LF on every checkout (their .sh and .py run in Linux containers; the rest does not mind),
# batch files CRLF for cmd.exe, pictures and prebuilt libraries as they are.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
